       "so this score measures the CPU, not the graphics chip. Check the driver: lspci -k (Kernel driver in use) and dmesg.'; fi; rm -f /tmp/.gpu-test; "
       "if [ $rc = 124 ] || [ $rc = 137 ]; then echo 'FAILED: the 3D benchmark stalled and was stopped after 150 s.'; "
       "echo 'A healthy GPU finishes in about a minute: suspect the graphics driver or GPU. Driver messages:'; "
